  "body": "The calls from https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hide-popover-algorithm to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#check-popover-validity don't pass the document to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#check-popover-validity, hence not checking it.\r\n\r\nSome, not all, of the calls from https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#show-popover to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#check-popover-validity check the document.\r\n\r\nMight be related to https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9367.\r\n\r\n",
